      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. You mentioned that the flute sounds more \"ethereal\" because of those harmonics. Are there any specific frequencies or certain overtones in the series that musicians often refer to as being particularly \"ghostly\" or difficult to control in terms of pitch stability?",
